d 'COINTPART': module to implement Cointegration by Parts -- FIEG, BIEG and GIEG subsample tests
d
d  cointpart tests whether two or more I(1) series cointegrate over
d part of the sample rather than throughout it. Standard
d residual-based tests apply a single window to the whole record
d and lose power when the long-run relationship holds over only a
d sub-period, because the stationary episode is diluted by the
d rest. 
d
d KW: cointegration
d KW: tests
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261029
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f cointpart.ado
f cointpart.sthlp
f cointpart_example.do
f cointpart_methods.sthlp
f cointpart_sealevel.dta
